* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.so binary
# Vendored crates: never normalize; cargo's .cargo-checksum.json is computed
# over the published bytes (some crates carry CRLF files upstream).
# Must come LAST so it overrides the glob rules above inside core/vendor.
core/vendor/** -text
